Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:14.289
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:19.119
Today we learn about Intro to Responsive Design. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.987 --> 00:00:24.746
Responsive design. Say it with me. Responsive design!

6
00:00:28.281 --> 00:00:32.599
Screen size. Say it with me. Screen size!

7
00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:40.669
Mobile-friendly. Say it with me. Mobile-friendly!

8
00:00:44.171 --> 00:00:48.489
Adapt layout. Say it with me. Adapt layout!

9
00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:55.947
Media query. Say it with me. Media query!

10
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:03.990
Flexible design. Say it with me. Flexible design!

11
00:01:07.449 --> 00:01:11.649
Cross-device. Say it with me. Cross-device!

12
00:01:15.199 --> 00:01:20.049
User experience. Say it with me. User experience!

13
00:01:23.526 --> 00:01:34.293
Responsive design makes a website mobile-friendly by adapting the layout to different screen sizes. A media query supports this flexible, cross-device experience.

14
00:01:34.343 --> 00:01:37.942
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:43.931
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.981 --> 00:01:45.448
Mobile-friendly!

17
00:01:46.623 --> 00:01:51.717
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:53.040
Cross-device!

19
00:01:54.272 --> 00:02:02.572
Did you know? More than half of all internet traffic worldwide now comes from mobile devices, making responsive design essential!

20
00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.913
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.265 --> 00:02:16.920
Think and answer. Why is responsive design important now that many people browse the internet on their phones?

22
00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.120
Great answer!

23
00:02:19.413 --> 00:02:24.804
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
